(1326, 388, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"8c0aa6c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"789012a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Welcome to the Future of Humanity\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"e41d7a1\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"a05b40a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>As biology and technology converge, human evolution is no longer dictated by nature alone \\u2014 it\\u2019s being <strong data-start=\\\"462\\\" data-end=\\\"476\\\">engineered<\\/strong>. At <strong data-start=\\\"481\\\" data-end=\\\"495\\\">Futurionix<\\/strong>, we are at the forefront of a new era: one where cybernetic enhancements extend not just life, but the very definition of what it means to be human.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Sarpanch\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":21,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#C3A7EB\",\"link_hover_color_transition_duration\":{\"unit\":\"s\",\"size\":1.4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"a228b4c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3a3581f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/GettyImages-1404749040.jpg\",\"id\":380,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\" robot-and-woman-facing-each-other\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"1536x1536\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ae755ef\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"033395c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Human augmentation is accelerating\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"f4abed5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul><li data-start=\\\"723\\\" data-end=\\\"823\\\"><p data-start=\\\"725\\\" data-end=\\\"823\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"725\\\" data-end=\\\"746\\\">Neural Interfaces<\\/strong> \\u2014 Direct brain-computer communication through high-fidelity neural implants.<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"824\\\" data-end=\\\"924\\\"><p data-start=\\\"826\\\" data-end=\\\"924\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"826\\\" data-end=\\\"861\\\">OptiSight\\u2122 Retinal Replacements<\\/strong> \\u2014 Vision beyond visible light: thermal, infrared, ultraviolet.<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"925\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\"><p data-start=\\\"927\\\" data-end=\\\"1036\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"927\\\" data-end=\\\"952\\\">SynthSkin\\u2122 &amp; ExoLimbs<\\/strong> \\u2014 Durable, responsive synthetic skin and limbs with force feedback and adaptive AI.<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Sarpanch\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":21,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#C3A7EB\",\"link_hover_color_transition_duration\":{\"unit\":\"s\",\"size\":1.4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"ad8b747\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0c6b6fe\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/960x0.webp\",\"id\":382,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"brains\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"2048x2048\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"76173a8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"693f919\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Why Cybernetics?\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"b078250\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul><li data-start=\\\"723\\\" data-end=\\\"823\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1069\\\" data-end=\\\"1144\\\">From repairing injury to <strong data-start=\\\"1094\\\" data-end=\\\"1123\\\">surpassing natural limits<\\/strong>, cybernetics offers:<\\/p><ul data-start=\\\"1146\\\" data-end=\\\"1292\\\"><li data-start=\\\"1146\\\" data-end=\\\"1180\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1148\\\" data-end=\\\"1180\\\">Restored mobility for amputees<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1181\\\" data-end=\\\"1212\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1183\\\" data-end=\\\"1212\\\">Enhanced sensory perception<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1213\\\" data-end=\\\"1253\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1215\\\" data-end=\\\"1253\\\">Increased cognitive processing speed<\\/p><\\/li><li data-start=\\\"1254\\\" data-end=\\\"1292\\\"><p data-start=\\\"1256\\\" data-end=\\\"1292\\\">Resilience in extreme environments<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul><p data-start=\\\"1294\\\" data-end=\\\"1366\\\">Our products are <strong data-start=\\\"1311\\\" data-end=\\\"1322\\\">modular<\\/strong>, <strong data-start=\\\"1324\\\" data-end=\\\"1342\\\">bio-compatible<\\/strong>, and <strong data-start=\\\"1348\\\" data-end=\\\"1365\\\">upgrade-ready<\\/strong>.<\\/p><\\/li><\\/ul>\",\"align\":\"left\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Sarpanch\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":21,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#C3A7EB\",\"link_hover_color_transition_duration\":{\"unit\":\"s\",\"size\":1.4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d861b61\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3b5c226\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Reprogramming Evolution\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"517ca4f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1069\\\" data-end=\\\"1144\\\">With CRISPR gene editing, nano-integrated implants, and cloud-linked cognition, <strong data-start=\\\"1486\\\" data-end=\\\"1532\\\">evolution is entering a programmable phase<\\/strong>. We\\u2019re not just adapting to the world \\u2014 we\\u2019re reshaping it around our enhanced capabilities.<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Sarpanch\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":21,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#C3A7EB\",\"link_hover_color_transition_duration\":{\"unit\":\"s\",\"size\":1.4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d00a986\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d80e09e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Explore Our Tech\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"628681c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1069\\\" data-end=\\\"1144\\\">\\ud83d\\udd39 NeuralSync\\u2122 Cognitive Link<br data-start=\\\"1687\\\" data-end=\\\"1690\\\" \\/>\\ud83d\\udd39 PulseArm\\u2122 Tactical Prosthetics<br data-start=\\\"1723\\\" data-end=\\\"1726\\\" \\/>\\ud83d\\udd39 VitaCore\\u2122 Cardiocircuit Augment<br data-start=\\\"1760\\\" data-end=\\\"1763\\\" \\/>\\ud83d\\udd39 OmniEar\\u2122 360\\u00ba Auditory System<\\/p>\",\"align\":\"center\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Sarpanch\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":21,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#C3A7EB\",\"link_hover_color_transition_duration\":{\"unit\":\"s\",\"size\":1.4,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"188d018\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5335627\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"carousel_name\":\"Image Carousel\",\"carousel\":[{\"id\":383,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\