(1535, 224, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"d76e923\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1600,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":156,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"11794a2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1bdb50a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"What Are We Sacrificing in the Name of Progress?\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"_flex_align_self\":\"flex-end\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"a89849f\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>As the age of cybernetic evolution accelerates, the promise of enhanced abilities comes with profound <strong data-start=\\\"484\\\" data-end=\\\"493\\\">risks<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"498\\\" data-end=\\\"518\\\">ethical dilemmas<\\/strong>. At Futurionix, we believe in pushing boundaries \\u2014 but not without responsibility.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"1c463ca\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/Progress-Isnt-Always-Linear-Be-Ready-to-Face-Challenges-in-the-Journey.webp\",\"id\":437,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"image_size\":\"2048x2048\",\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":267,\"sizes\":[]},\"object-fit\":\"fill\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"46\",\"right\":\"46\",\"bottom\":\"46\",\"left\":\"46\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"d702168\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":2,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"91b259e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"presetTitle\":\"Grid\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container-grid\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f91f844\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/360_F_1506306227_qVpxm0N9eyZy1fOrFDM22C27QOGDtsjy.jpg\",\"id\":438,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":277,\"sizes\":[]},\"object-fit\":\"fill\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"46\",\"right\":\"46\",\"bottom\":\"46\",\"left\":\"46\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"},{\"id\":\"6573c8d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/04\\/central-cyber-hub-military-surveillance-officer-tracking-city-operations-national-security-army-communications_27525-36001.jpg\",\"id\":439,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"align\":\"center\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"space\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100,\"sizes\":[]},\"height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":262,\"sizes\":[]},\"object-fit\":\"fill\",\"image_border_radius\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"46\",\"right\":\"46\",\"bottom\":\"46\",\"left\":\"46\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"07f7523\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"presetTitle\":\"Container\",\"presetIcon\":\"eicon-container\",\"boxed_width\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":1131,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":1,\"sizes\":[]},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_flex_order\":\"end\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"34c0f0c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Ethical Crossroads\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"right\",\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_flex_align_self\":\"center\",\"_flex_size\":\"none\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"741b9be\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<ul>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1474\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1477\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1477\\\" data-end=\\\"1495\\\">Human Identity<\\/strong><br data-start=\\\"1495\\\" data-end=\\\"1498\\\" \\/>When do we stop being human? Is there a point where too much augmentation crosses into post-human territory \\u2014 and who defines that limit?<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1640\\\" data-end=\\\"1832\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1643\\\" data-end=\\\"1832\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1643\\\" data-end=\\\"1666\\\">Access &amp; Inequality<\\/strong><br data-start=\\\"1666\\\" data-end=\\\"1669\\\" \\/>Will enhancements be available to all, or only the wealthy? Cybernetics could deepen the divide between the <strong data-start=\\\"1780\\\" data-end=\\\"1799\\\">augmented elite<\\/strong> and the <strong data-start=\\\"1808\\\" data-end=\\\"1831\\\">unmodified majority<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1834\\\" data-end=\\\"1983\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1837\\\" data-end=\\\"1983\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1837\\\" data-end=\\\"1859\\\">Consent &amp; Autonomy<\\/strong><br data-start=\\\"1859\\\" data-end=\\\"1862\\\" \\/>Are users fully informed about the risks? Are children or vulnerable individuals being augmented without true consent?<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<li data-start=\\\"1985\\\" data-end=\\\"2173\\\">\\n<p data-start=\\\"1988\\\" data-end=\\\"2173\\\"><strong data-start=\\\"1988\\\" data-end=\\\"2022\\\">Military &amp; Surveillance Misuse<\\/strong><br data-start=\\\"2022\\\" data-end=\\\"2025\\\" \\/>Enhanced soldiers, surveillance implants, and brain-controlled drones raise concerns of <strong data-start=\\\"2116\\\" data-end=\\\"2143\\\">weaponized augmentation<\\/strong> and <strong data-start=\\\"2148\\\" data-end=\\\"2172\\\">civil rights erosion<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\\n<\\/li>\\n<\\/ul>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"73ae795\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1a5f3d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"The Hidden Dangers\",\"header_size\":\"h3\",\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"bdedf48\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"nested-accordion\",\"settings\":{\"items\":[{\"item_title\":\"Security Vulnerabilities\",\"_id\":\"7ec6c4b\"},{\"item_title\":\"Systemic Malfunctions\",\"_id\":\"77b2df6\"},{\"item_title\":\"Rejection & Degradation\",\"_id\":\"9c34571\"},{\"_id\":\"aef00e8\",\"item_title\":\"Dependence on Upgrades\"}],\"title_typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"title_typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":26,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_typography_font_style\":\"normal\",\"normal_title_color\":\"#73C8F6\",\"hover_title_color\":\"#175BB2\",\"active_title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"icon_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":27,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"ab495ad\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"item #1\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"12c8fdd\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1477\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\">Connected implants may be <strong data-start=\\\"698\\\" data-end=\\\"708\\\">hacked<\\/strong>, leading to loss of control, surveillance, or even bodily harm. Bio-firewalls and quantum encryption are essential, but no system is flawless.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true,\"isLocked\":true},{\"id\":\"48f2ba3\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"item #2\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"bbdaa08\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1477\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\">Glitches or firmware failures in critical implants (like neural links or cardiac augments) could result in <strong data-start=\\\"994\\\" data-end=\\\"1014\\\">cognitive lapses<\\/strong>, physical harm, or even death.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true,\"isLocked\":true},{\"id\":\"2e365bb\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"item #3\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c805ae5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1477\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\">Even advanced materials can be rejected by the body or degrade over time, leading to complications such as <strong data-start=\\\"1190\\\" data-end=\\\"1203\\\">infection<\\/strong>, <strong data-start=\\\"1205\\\" data-end=\\\"1221\\\">nerve damage<\\/strong>, or <strong data-start=\\\"1226\\\" data-end=\\\"1245\\\">implant fatigue<\\/strong>.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true,\"isLocked\":true},{\"id\":\"9a77cd8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"Item #4\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4d0e71a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p data-start=\\\"1477\\\" data-end=\\\"1638\\\">What begins as enhancement may become <strong data-start=\\\"1321\\\" data-end=\\\"1335\\\">dependency<\\/strong>. Without regular software updates or hardware replacements, enhanced users may lose basic functionality.<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true,\"isLocked\":true}]}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
