(789, 3, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"67ed749\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"c4ed947\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"style\":\"x_tribal\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#1B97A3\",\"pattern_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":26.7,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"5d24ecfa\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"560916d8\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Who we are<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><strong>Our website address is: <a class=\\\"\\\" href=\\\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix\\\" target=\\\"_new\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" data-start=\\\"180\\\" data-end=\\\"238\\\">http:\\/\\/localhost\\/futurionix<\\/a><\\/strong><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Comments<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"241\\\" data-end=\\\"488\\\"><em>When visitors leave comments on our site, we collect the data shown in the comments form, along with the visitor\\u2019s IP address and browser user agent string. This data helps us detect potential cybernetic \\\"glitches\\\" and prevent spam.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"490\\\" data-end=\\\"880\\\"><em>An anonymized string created from your email address (also called a hash) may be shared with the Gravatar service to verify if you\'re using it. The Gravatar service privacy policy is available here: <a class=\\\"\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/automattic.com\\/privacy\\/\\\" target=\\\"_new\\\" rel=\\\"noopener\\\" data-start=\\\"689\\\" data-end=\\\"755\\\">https:\\/\\/automattic.com\\/privacy\\/<\\/a>. After approval of your comment, your profile picture (if any) will be visible to the public in the context of your comment.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Media<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><em>If you upload images to our digital realm, please avoid uploading files with embedded location data (EXIF GPS). Visitors to our site can extract this data from images, so protect your coordinates from unwanted tracking.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Cookies<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1115\\\" data-end=\\\"1369\\\"><em>When you leave a comment, you may opt-in to saving your name, email address, and website in cookies. These are for your convenience, so you don\\u2019t have to re-enter your details on future visits. These cookies will remain active for one year.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1371\\\" data-end=\\\"1565\\\"><em>When you visit our login page, we will set a temporary cookie to determine if your browser can accept cookies. This cookie contains no personal data and is discarded when you close your browser.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1567\\\" data-end=\\\"1845\\\"><em>Upon logging in, we\\u2019ll set cookies to save your login information and display preferences. Login cookies persist for two days, while display preferences last for a year. If you choose \\\"Remember Me,\\\" your login remains active for two weeks. Logging out will delete these cookies.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p class=\\\"\\\" data-start=\\\"1847\\\" data-end=\\\"2032\\\"><em>If you edit or publish an article, an additional cookie is saved. This cookie holds no personal data and only records the post ID of the article you just edited. It expires after 1 day.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Embedded content from other websites<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><em>Articles on this site may include embedded content (e.g. videos, images, articles, etc.). Embedded content from other websites behaves in the exact same way as if the visitor has visited the other website.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p><em><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p><em>These websites may collect data about you, use cookies, embed additional third-party tracking, and monitor your interaction with that embedded content, including tracking your interaction with the embedded content if you have an account and are logged in to that website.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Who we share your data with<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><em>If you request a password reset, your IP address will be included in the reset email.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">How long we retain your data<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><em>If you leave a comment, the comment and its metadata are retained indefinitely. This is so we can recognize and approve any follow-up comments automatically instead of holding them in a moderation queue.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p><em><!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><\\/em><\\/p>\\n<p><em>For users that register on our website (if any), we also store the personal information they provide in their user profile. All users can see, edit, or delete their personal information at any time (except they cannot change their username). Website administrators can also see and edit that information.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">What rights you have over your data<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><em>If you have an account on this site, or have left comments, you can request to receive an exported file of the personal data we hold about you, including any data you have provided to us. You can also request that we erase any personal data we hold about you. This does not include any data we are obliged to keep for administrative, legal, or security purposes.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading -->\\n<h2 class=\\\"wp-block-heading\\\">Where your data is sent<\\/h2>\\n<!-- \\/wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph -->\\n<p><em>Visitor comments may be scanned by automated spam detection systems\\u2014think of it as a \\\"cybersecurity check\\\" to protect your data and ensure smooth operations.<\\/em><\\/p>\\n<!-- \\/wp:paragraph -->\\n<p>\\u00a0<\\/p>\",\"text_color\":\"#8C4FD1\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"7469af2\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"5fad9bb\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"style\":\"x_tribal\",\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#1B97A3\",\"pattern_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":26.7,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"}],\"isInner\":false}]'),
