(159, 1, '2025-04-04 16:31:14', '2025-04-04 16:31:14', 'What are cybernetic implants?				\n		<p>Cybernetic implants are technological devices integrated into the human body to enhance or expand its capabilities. They range from simple medical devices, such as pacemakers, to advanced neuroimplants that connect the mind to computer interfaces.</p>		\n															<img width=\"863\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic.png 863w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic-300x285.png 300w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic-768x731.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 863px) 100vw, 863px\" />															\n				A history of human enhancements – from pacemakers to future cyborgs				\n		<p>The history of cybernetic enhancements began with medical devices such as hearing aids and heart pacemakers. Today, technology is advancing towards bionic limbs, neural interfaces, and organs beyond human capabilities.</p>https://youtu.be/-b5BZASM0IE?si=Kn7vfs1sl363nrA9		\n				Futurionix and the future of bio-synthetic enhancements				\n		<p>Futurionix is ​​developing revolutionary cybernetic technologies that combine biology and synthetics. Their innovations include adaptive implants that can evolve and improve over time.</p>		\n															<img width=\"612\" height=\"408\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/neuroenhancer-bio-synthetic-circuits-bio-synthetic-augmentation-human-enhancement-cybernetic-fu_981101-126453-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/neuroenhancer-bio-synthetic-circuits-bio-synthetic-augmentation-human-enhancement-cybernetic-fu_981101-126453-removebg-preview.png 612w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/neuroenhancer-bio-synthetic-circuits-bio-synthetic-augmentation-human-enhancement-cybernetic-fu_981101-126453-removebg-preview-300x200.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 612px) 100vw, 612px\" />', 'Cybernetic evolution: How technology can upgrade human\'s body?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '151-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-04 16:31:14', '2025-04-04 16:31:14', '', 151, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=159', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(160, 1, '2025-04-04 16:31:15', '2025-04-04 16:31:15', 'What are cybernetic implants?				\n		<p>Cybernetic implants are technological devices integrated into the human body to enhance or expand its capabilities. They range from simple medical devices, such as pacemakers, to advanced neuroimplants that connect the mind to computer interfaces.</p>		\n															<img width=\"863\" height=\"821\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic.png 863w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic-300x285.png 300w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/biotic-768x731.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 863px) 100vw, 863px\" />															\n				A history of human enhancements – from pacemakers to future cyborgs				\n		<p>The history of cybernetic enhancements began with medical devices such as hearing aids and heart pacemakers. Today, technology is advancing towards bionic limbs, neural interfaces, and organs beyond human capabilities.</p>https://youtu.be/-b5BZASM0IE?si=Kn7vfs1sl363nrA9		\n				Futurionix and the future of bio-synthetic enhancements				\n		<p>Futurionix is ​​developing revolutionary cybernetic technologies that combine biology and synthetics. Their innovations include adaptive implants that can evolve and improve over time.</p>		\n															<img width=\"612\" height=\"408\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/neuroenhancer-bio-synthetic-circuits-bio-synthetic-augmentation-human-enhancement-cybernetic-fu_981101-126453-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/neuroenhancer-bio-synthetic-circuits-bio-synthetic-augmentation-human-enhancement-cybernetic-fu_981101-126453-removebg-preview.png 612w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/neuroenhancer-bio-synthetic-circuits-bio-synthetic-augmentation-human-enhancement-cybernetic-fu_981101-126453-removebg-preview-300x200.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 612px) 100vw, 612px\" />', 'Cybernetic evolution: How technology can upgrade human\'s body?', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '151-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-04 16:31:15', '2025-04-04 16:31:15', '', 151, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=160', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
