cHJldmlldy5wbmciLCJzbGlkZXNob3ciOiJlMDI3Y2YzIn0%3D\" href=\'http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/detailed-view-cybernetic-limb-muscle-fiber-integration-illustrating-future-replacement-326349600-removebg-preview.png\'><img width=\"575\" height=\"434\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/detailed-view-cybernetic-limb-muscle-fiber-integration-illustrating-future-replacement-326349600-removebg-preview.png\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/detailed-view-cybernetic-limb-muscle-fiber-integration-illustrating-future-replacement-326349600-removebg-preview.png 575w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/detailed-view-cybernetic-limb-muscle-fiber-integration-illustrating-future-replacement-326349600-removebg-preview-300x226.png 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 575px) 100vw, 575px\" /></a>\n			</figure>\n					<h2>5. Improved hearing implants</h2>				\n		<p>They pick up sounds outside the human range.</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/912FBA81-9CBF-4084-ACF6-67EE3F8B9F98_-removebg-preview-150x150.png\" alt=\"_912FBA81-9CBF-4084-ACF6-67EE3F8B9F98_-removebg-preview\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/mental_order_ch_1-removebg-preview-150x150.png\" alt=\"mental_order_ch_1-removebg-preview\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/bionic-ear-implant-improving-hearing-abilities-created-with-generative-ai_419341-37885-removebg-preview-150x150.png\" alt=\"bionic-ear-implant-improving-hearing-abilities-created-with-generative-ai_419341-37885-removebg-preview\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/CC8103CA-5643-4353-B7CE-01A462C7D9D8_-removebg-preview-150x150.png\" alt=\"_CC8103CA-5643-4353-B7CE-01A462C7D9D8_-removebg-preview\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/EEEA2019-5442-45F7-B0DB-6FE4718BF882_-removebg-preview-150x150.png\" alt=\"_EEEA2019-5442-45F7-B0DB-6FE4718BF882_-removebg-preview\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>					\n					<h2>6. Synthetic skin</h2>				\n		<p><strong>Self-regenerating and resistant to injury.</strong></p>		\n															<img width=\"193\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/WeirdTankyPlating.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"160\" height=\"158\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/zPxvvih.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"204\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n															<img width=\"187\" height=\"200\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/3.png\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h2>7. Implanted communication devices</h2>				\n		<p><strong>Direct connection to smartphones and the internet.</strong></p>		\n															<img width=\"800\" height=\"530\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/5829ba9515245.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/5829ba9515245.jpg 800w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/5829ba9515245-300x199.jpg 300w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/5829ba9515245-768x509.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />															\n					<h2>8. Cybernetic hands</h2>				\n		<p><strong>With multi-function fingers and hidden tools.</strong></p>		\n															<img width=\"450\" height=\"338\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/3d17f46d3ea30dc0b94a9ff4a4d1a380.gif\" alt=\"\" />															\n					<h2>9. Smart prosthetics</h2>				\n		<p><strong>Integrated with AI for predictive movements.</strong></p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/a9763541482d3629_400x400ar-removebg-preview-200x300.png\" alt=\"a9763541482d3629_400x400ar-removebg-preview\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/03_smartprostheticarm_xanderlihovski_smarttech-removebg-preview-199x300.png\" alt=\"03_smartprostheticarm_xanderlihovski_smarttech-removebg-preview\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/uygbuhb-247x300.png\" alt=\"uygbuhb\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/wruol1hm-removebg-preview-300x300.png\" alt=\"wruol1hm-removebg-preview\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>					\n					<h2>10. Futurionix Technologies</h2>				\n		<p><strong>Customized upgrades for human evolution.</strong></p>		\n															<img width=\"540\" height=\"540\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/e8c9135c016eebe293465babf6e6e39d-ezgif.com-optimize.gif\" alt=\"\" />', '10 cybernetic implants that will change your life', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '175-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-04 20:20:27', '2025-04-04 20:20:27', '', 175, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=221', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(222, 1, '2025-04-04 20:21:54', '2025-04-04 20:21:54', '<p>Prosthetics have come a long way—from wooden pegs to advanced cybernetic limbs that do more than restore function—they <strong data-start=\"243\" data-end=\"254\">enhance</strong> it.</p>		\n					<h2>The Journey</h2>				\n		<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Connected implants may be <strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"708\">hacked</strong>, leading to loss of control, surveillance, or even bodily harm. Bio-firewalls and quantum encryption are essential, but no system is flawless.</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Неозаглавен-дизайн.png\" alt=\"Неозаглавен дизайн\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Неозаглавен-дизайн1.png\" alt=\"Неозаглавен дизайн(1)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Неозаглавен-дизайн2.png\" alt=\"Неозаглавен дизайн(2)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/06/Неозаглавен-дизайн3.png\" alt=\"Неозаглавен дизайн(3)\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>					\n		<p><strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"301\">1. Early prosthetics:</strong> Simple wooden or metal tools for basic use.</p><p><strong data-start=\"350\" data-end=\"371\">2. Mechanical limbs:</strong> Used cables and joints for movement.</p><p><strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"301\">3. </strong><strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"435\">Myoelectric limbs:</strong> Controlled by muscle signals for intuitive use.</p><p><strong data-start=\"279\" data-end=\"301\">4. </strong><strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"518\">Neural-linked cybernetics:</strong> Today’s limbs connect directly to the nervous system, providing movement and even sensory feedback.</p>		\n					<h2>Today’s Cyber-Limbs</h2>				\n		<p data-start=\"647\" data-end=\"667\"><em>AI-driven movement</em></p><p data-start=\"670\" data-end=\"698\"><em>Realistic tactile feedback</em></p><p data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"733\"><em>Lightweight, durable materials</em></p><p><em>Adaptive learning software</em></p>', 'From Organic to Mechanical: The Evolution of Cybernetic Limbs', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'from-organic-to-mechanical-the-evolution-of-cybernetic-limbs', '', '', '2025-06-25 00:25:04', '2025-06-25 00:25:04', '', 0, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=222', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(223, 1, '2025-04-04 20:21:48', '2025-04-04 20:21:48', '', 'From Organic to Mechanical: The Evolution of Cybernetic Limbs', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '222-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-04 20:21:48', '2025-04-04 20:21:48', '', 222, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=223', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(224, 1, '2025-04-04 20:22:34', '2025-04-04 20:22:34', '<h3>What Are We Sacrificing in the Name of Progress?</h3>				\n		<p>As the age of cybernetic evolution accelerates, the promise of enhanced abilities comes with profound <strong data-start=\"484\" data-end=\"493\">risks</strong> and <strong data-start=\"498\" data-end=\"518\">ethical dilemmas</strong>. At Futurionix, we believe in pushing boundaries — but not without responsibility.</p>		\n															<img width=\"1296\" height=\"700\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Progress-Isnt-Always-Linear-Be-Ready-to-Face-Challenges-in-the-Journey.webp\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Progress-Isnt-Always-Linear-Be-Ready-to-Face-Challenges-in-the-Journey.webp 1296w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Progress-Isnt-Always-Linear-Be-Ready-to-Face-Challenges-in-the-Journey-300x162.webp 300w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Progress-Isnt-Always-Linear-Be-Ready-to-Face-Challenges-in-the-Journey-1024x553.webp 1024w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Progress-Isnt-Always-Linear-Be-Ready-to-Face-Challenges-in-the-Journey-768x415.webp 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1296px) 100vw, 1296px\" />															\n															<img width=\"540\" height=\"360\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/360_F_1506306227_qVpxm0N9eyZy1fOrFDM22C27QOGDtsjy.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/360_F_1506306227_qVpxm0N9eyZy1fOrFDM22C27QOGDtsjy.jpg 540w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/360_F_1506306227_qVpxm0N9eyZy1fOrFDM22C27QOGDtsjy-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 540px) 100vw, 540px\" />															\n															<img width=\"626\" height=\"417\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/central-cyber-hub-military-surveillance-officer-tracking-city-operations-national-security-army-communications_27525-36001.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/central-cyber-hub-military-surveillance-officer-tracking-city-operations-national-security-army-communications_27525-36001.jpg 626w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/central-cyber-hub-military-surveillance-officer-tracking-city-operations-national-security-army-communications_27525-36001-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 626px) 100vw, 626px\" />															\n					<h3>Ethical Crossroads</h3>				\n		<ul>\n<li data-start=\"1474\" data-end=\"1638\">\n<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\"><strong data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1495\">Human Identity</strong><br data-start=\"1495\" data-end=\"1498\" />When do we stop being human? Is there a point where too much augmentation crosses into post-human territory — and who defines that limit?</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1640\" data-end=\"1832\">\n<p data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1832\"><strong data-start=\"1643\" data-end=\"1666\">Access &amp; Inequality</strong><br data-start=\"1666\" data-end=\"1669\" />Will enhancements be available to all, or only the wealthy? Cybernetics could deepen the divide between the <strong data-start=\"1780\" data-end=\"1799\">augmented elite</strong> and the <strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1831\">unmodified majority</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1834\" data-end=\"1983\">\n<p data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1983\"><strong data-start=\"1837\" data-end=\"1859\">Consent &amp; Autonomy</strong><br data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1862\" />Are users fully informed about the risks? Are children or vulnerable individuals being augmented without true consent?</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1985\" data-end=\"2173\">\n<p data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2173\"><strong data-start=\"1988\" data-end=\"2022\">Military &amp; Surveillance Misuse</strong><br data-start=\"2022\" data-end=\"2025\" />Enhanced soldiers, surveillance implants, and brain-controlled drones raise concerns of <strong data-start=\"2116\" data-end=\"2143\">weaponized augmentation</strong> and <strong data-start=\"2148\" data-end=\"2172\">civil rights erosion</strong>.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>		\n					<h3>The Hidden Dangers</h3>				\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1990\" open>\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"1\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-expanded=\"true\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1990\" >\n					 Security Vulnerabilities \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n									<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Connected implants may be <strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"708\">hacked</strong>, leading to loss of control, surveillance, or even bodily harm. Bio-firewalls and quantum encryption are essential, but no system is flawless.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1991\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"2\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1991\" >\n					 Systemic Malfunctions \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n									<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Glitches or firmware failures in critical implants (like neural links or cardiac augments) could result in <strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1014\">cognitive lapses</strong>, physical harm, or even death.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1992\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"3\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1992\" >\n					 Rejection &amp; Degradation \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n									<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Even advanced materials can be rejected by the body or degrade over time, leading to complications such as <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1203\">infection</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1221\">nerve damage</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1245\">implant fatigue</strong>.</p>								\n					</details>\n						<details id=\"e-n-accordion-item-1993\" >\n				<summary data-accordion-index=\"4\" tabindex=\"-1\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"e-n-accordion-item-1993\" >\n					 Dependence on Upgrades \n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h384c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 448 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M416 208H272V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v144H32c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v32c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h144v144c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h32c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V304h144c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32v-32c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32z\"></path></svg>\n						</summary>\n									<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">What begins as enhancement may become <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1335\">dependency</strong>. Without regular software updates or hardware replacements, enhanced users may lose basic functionality.</p>								\n					</details>\n		<p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Connected implants may be <strong data-start=\"698\" data-end=\"708\">hacked</strong>, leading to loss of control, surveillance, or even bodily harm. Bio-firewalls and quantum encryption are essential, but no system is flawless.</p><p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Glitches or firmware failures in critical implants (like neural links or cardiac augments) could result in <strong data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1014\">cognitive lapses</strong>, physical harm, or even death.</p><p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">Even advanced materials can be rejected by the body or degrade over time, leading to complications such as <strong data-start=\"1190\" data-end=\"1203\">infection</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1205\" data-end=\"1221\">nerve damage</strong>, or <strong data-start=\"1226\" data-end=\"1245\">implant fatigue</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"1477\" data-end=\"1638\">What begins as enhancement may become <strong data-start=\"1321\" data-end=\"1335\">dependency</strong>. Without regular software updates or hardware replacements, enhanced users may lose basic functionality.</p>', 'Dangers and Ethics of Cyber ​​Enhancements', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'dangers-and-ethics-of-cyber-enhancements', '', '', '2025-06-25 00:24:27', '2025-06-25 00:24:27', '', 0, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=224', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(225, 1, '2025-04-04 20:22:34', '2025-04-04 20:22:34', '', 'Dangers and Ethics of Cyber ​​Enhancements', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '224-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-04 20:22:34', '2025-04-04 20:22:34', '', 224, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=225', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(226, 1, '2025-04-04 20:23:13', '2025-04-04 20:23:13', '<h3>Welcome to the Future of Humanity</h3>				\n		<p>As biology and technology converge, human evolution is no longer dictated by nature alone — it’s being <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"476\">engineered</strong>. At <strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"495\">Futurionix</strong>, we are at the forefront of a new era: one where cybernetic enhancements extend not just life, but the very definition of what it means to be human.</p>		\n															<img width=\"788\" height=\"443\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/GettyImages-1404749040.jpg\" alt=\"robot-and-woman-facing-each-other\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/GettyImages-1404749040.jpg 788w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/GettyImages-1404749040-300x169.jpg 300w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/GettyImages-1404749040-768x432.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 788px) 100vw, 788px\" />															\n					<h3>Human augmentation is accelerating</h3>				\n		<ul><li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"823\"><p data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"823\"><strong data-start=\"725\" data-end=\"746\">Neural Interfaces</strong> — Direct brain-computer communication through high-fidelity neural implants.</p></li><li data-start=\"824\" data-end=\"924\"><p data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"924\"><strong data-start=\"826\" data-end=\"861\">OptiSight™ Retinal Replacements</strong> — Vision beyond visible light: thermal, infrared, ultraviolet.</p></li><li data-start=\"925\" data-end=\"1036\"><p data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"1036\"><strong data-start=\"927\" data-end=\"952\">SynthSkin™ &amp; ExoLimbs</strong> — Durable, responsive synthetic skin and limbs with force feedback and adaptive AI.</p></li></ul>		\n															<img width=\"710\" height=\"473\" src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/960x0.webp\" alt=\"brains\" srcset=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/960x0.webp 710w, http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/960x0-300x200.webp 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 710px) 100vw, 710px\" />															\n					<h3>Why Cybernetics?</h3>				\n		<ul><li data-start=\"723\" data-end=\"823\"><p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1144\">From repairing injury to <strong data-start=\"1094\" data-end=\"1123\">surpassing natural limits</strong>, cybernetics offers:</p><ul data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1292\"><li data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1180\"><p data-start=\"1148\" data-end=\"1180\">Restored mobility for amputees</p></li><li data-start=\"1181\" data-end=\"1212\"><p data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1212\">Enhanced sensory perception</p></li><li data-start=\"1213\" data-end=\"1253\"><p data-start=\"1215\" data-end=\"1253\">Increased cognitive processing speed</p></li><li data-start=\"1254\" data-end=\"1292\"><p data-start=\"1256\" data-end=\"1292\">Resilience in extreme environments</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1294\" data-end=\"1366\">Our products are <strong data-start=\"1311\" data-end=\"1322\">modular</strong>, <strong data-start=\"1324\" data-end=\"1342\">bio-compatible</strong>, and <strong data-start=\"1348\" data-end=\"1365\">upgrade-ready</strong>.</p></li></ul>		\n					<h3>Reprogramming Evolution</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1144\">With CRISPR gene editing, nano-integrated implants, and cloud-linked cognition, <strong data-start=\"1486\" data-end=\"1532\">evolution is entering a programmable phase</strong>. We’re not just adapting to the world — we’re reshaping it around our enhanced capabilities.</p>		\n					<h3>Explore Our Tech</h3>				\n		<p data-start=\"1069\" data-end=\"1144\">🔹 NeuralSync™ Cognitive Link<br data-start=\"1687\" data-end=\"1690\" />🔹 PulseArm™ Tactical Prosthetics<br data-start=\"1723\" data-end=\"1726\" />🔹 VitaCore™ Cardiocircuit Augment<br data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1763\" />🔹 OmniEar™ 360º Auditory System</p>		\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Hololiminals-Subliminal-Programming-by-NeuralSync-2048x1148-1-768x431.jpg\" alt=\"An immersive 3D visualization of a puzzle brain being assembled in mid-air, with pieces floating and coming together in a seamless animation. The background is a cosmic vista, symbolizing the vastness of human thought and the universe of the mind. The focus is on the precision and intricacy of the puzzle&#039;s design\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/1642018790013-768x578.jpg\" alt=\"Hand and implant\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/3Dio_OmniPro_EarCloseup_2400x1600_WebReady_grande.jpg\" alt=\"360hearing\" /></figure>			\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M646 125C629 125 613 133 604 142L308 442C296 454 292 471 292 487 292 504 296 521 308 533L604 854C617 867 629 875 646 875 663 875 679 871 692 858 704 846 713 829 713 812 713 796 708 779 692 767L438 487 692 225C700 217 708 204 708 187 708 171 704 154 692 142 675 129 663 125 646 125Z\"></path></svg>					\n						<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 1000\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M696 533C708 521 713 504 713 487 713 471 708 454 696 446L400 146C388 133 375 125 354 125 338 125 325 129 313 142 300 154 292 171 292 187 292 204 296 221 308 233L563 492 304 771C292 783 288 800 288 817 288 833 296 850 308 863 321 871 338 875 354 875 371 875 388 867 400 854L696 533Z\"></path></svg>', 'What\'s Next? The Future of Human Evolution', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'whats-next-the-future-of-human-evolution', '', '', '2025-06-24 21:09:53', '2025-06-24 21:09:53', '', 0, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=226', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(227, 1, '2025-04-04 20:23:13', '2025-04-04 20:23:13', '', 'What\'s Next? The Future of Human Evolution', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '226-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-04 20:23:13', '2025-04-04 20:23:13', '', 226, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=227', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
