(379, 1, '2025-06-24 20:45:20', '2025-06-24 20:45:20', '<h3>Welcome to the Future of Humanity</h3>				\n		<p>As biology and technology converge, human evolution is no longer dictated by nature alone — it’s being <strong data-start=\"462\" data-end=\"476\">engineered</strong>. At <strong data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"495\">Futurionix</strong>, we are at the forefront of a new era: one where cybernetic enhancements extend not just life, but the very definition of what it means to be human.</p>', 'What\'s Next? The Future of Human Evolution', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '226-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-06-24 20:45:20', '2025-06-24 20:45:20', '', 226, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=379', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
