xt of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-purple\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-purple\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Sanchez\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\">Aya ensures that every cybernetic enhancement we create is aligned with our values of responsibility and transparency, focusing on enhancing lives while safeguarding privacy and autonomy.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/container {\"blockClientId\":\"5d8ec209-0e50-4826-ac8f-65f7ac26d83e\",\"borderRadius\":{\"topL\":64,\"topR\":64,\"bottomL\":64,\"bottomR\":64}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cozy-block-container\"><div class=\"cozy-block-container visibility-none border-none hover-border-none\n        \n    \" id=\"cozyBlock_5d8ec209_0e50_4826_ac8f_65f7ac26d83e\"><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:10\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"x-large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size\"><strong>Ronan Vale</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|primary-shade-one\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"primary-shade-one\",\"fontSize\":\"large\",\"