trong>Futurionix</strong>, we don’t just create cybernetic enhancements—we revolutionize the way humans interact with technology and we want to make sure that their concerns are addressed properly. Our mission is to <strong>push the limits of human potential</strong> through cutting-edge biomechanical upgrades that are designed for <strong>performance, precision, and personalization</strong>. Whether you\'re looking to enhance strength, improve vision, or optimize endurance, <strong>Futurionix is your gateway to the future</strong>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/slider {\"blockClientId\":\"7c38d444-d3dd-4306-af2d-bca3cc75206d\",\"pagination\":{\"width\":\"10px\",\"height\":\"10px\",\"borderRadius\":\"100px\",\"activeWidth\":\"31px\",\"activeHeight\":\"10px\",\"activeBorder\":{\"width\":\"\",\"style\":\"\",\"color\":\"\"},\"activeOffset\":\"4px\",\"activeBorderRadius\":\"100px\",\"bottom\":0,\"left\":0,\"right\":0,\"align\":\"center\",\"gap\":\"10px\",\"activeColor\":\"#007cba\",\"color\":\"#fff\",\"activeColorHover\":\"#164861\",\"colorHover\":\"#a5a5a5\",\"activeBorderHover\":\"\",\"dynamicBullets\":false},\"sliderOptions\":{\"loop\":false,\"autoplay\":{\"status\":true,\"pauseOnMouseEnter\":true,\"delay\":2400},\"slidesPerView\":1,\"centeredSlides\":false,\"spaceBetween\":26,\"speed\":1500,\"effect\":\"none\"},\"thumbMedia\":[\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\",\"\"],\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"transparent\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cozy-block-slider has-transparent-background-color has-background\" style=\"border-radius:50px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><div class=\"cozy-block-slider swiper-container hover-show \" id=\"cozyBlock_7c38d444_d3dd_4306_af2d_bca3cc75206d\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><!-- wp:cozy-block/slide {\"blockClientId\":\"25a3d505-842f-4d69-a324-d7ad1fd87a6c\"} -->\n<!-- wp:cover {\"dimRatio\":50} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Slide Title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">What makes Futurionix implants different from standard medical devices?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"pale-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"big\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Fenix\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-big-font-size\"><strong>Futurionix </strong>implants aren’t just for restoring lost functions — they enhance and evolve the human body. We integrate AI, adaptive synthetic materials, and neural interfaces for seamless connection between mind and machine.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\"></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/slide -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/slide {\"blockClientId\":\"0c5a31f5-196a-4a80-95df-e4ab6c002990\"} -->\n<!-- wp:cover {\"dimRatio\":50} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Slide Title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Are cybernetic enhancements safe?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"pale-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"big\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Fenix\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-big-font-size\"><strong>Yes</strong>. All Futurionix implants are tested under extreme conditions and protected by advanced encryption, anti-tamper systems, and biometric security to prevent unauthorized access or cyberattacks.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\"></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/slide -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/slide {\"blockClientId\":\"d7ea8f5a-9086-45af-b0a7-96d732a25172\"} -->\n<!-- wp:cover {\"dimRatio\":50} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Slide Title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\">Can the implants evolve or upgrade over time?</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"pale-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"big\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Fenix\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-big-font-size\"><strong>Absolutely</strong>. Our bio-synthetic systems support self-optimization, allowing upgrades, regeneration, and performance tuning as your needs change — just like software, but for your body.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\"></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/slide -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/slide {\"blockClientId\":\"518205c9-6304-4578-b103-7b98507c8559\"} -->\n<!-- wp:cover {\"dimRatio\":50,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Slide Title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Is surgery required for implantation?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"pale-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"big\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Fenix\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-big-font-size\">Most devices are installed using minimally invasive techniques. Some next-gen implants are even deployed via nanobots, enabling painless and fast integration with minimal downtime.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\"></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/slide -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/slide {\"blockClientId\":\"774c8ea3-8dee-4916-9c31-0cd5df4cc0cf\"} -->\n<!-- wp:cover {\"dimRatio\":50,\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"default\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"right\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-right:0;padding-left:0\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Slide Title\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\"><strong>Can I customize my enhancements?</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|pale-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"pale-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"big\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Fenix\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-pale-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-big-font-size\"><strong>Yes</strong>. From function and performance to aesthetic appearance, every implant can be tailored to your identity. You don’t just wear technology — you become it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\"></a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/slide --></div><div class=\"swiper-button-prev cozy-block-button-prev\"></div><div class=\"swiper-button-next cozy-block-button-next\"></div><div class=\"swiper-pagination cozy-pagination\"></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/slider --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:button {\"backgroundColor\":\"tertiary\",\"textColor\":\"foregound-alt\",\"className\":\"saaslauncher-scrollto-top is-style-button-hover-secondary-bgcolor\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50%\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button saaslauncher-scrollto-top is-style-button-hover-secondary-bgcolor\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-foregound-alt-color has-tertiary-background-color has-text-color has-background wp-element-button\" style=\"border-radius:50%\">Scroll to Top</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button --></div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons --></main>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"footer\",\"theme\":\"saaslauncher\",\"area\":\"footer\"} /-->', 'Front Page', 'Displays your site\'s homepage, whether it is set to display latest posts or a static page. The Front Page template takes precedence over all templates.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '59-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-04-06 15:34:10', '2025-04-06 15:34:10', '', 59, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=299', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
INSERT INTO `wp_posts` (`ID`, `post_author`, `post_date`, `post_date_gmt`, `post_content`, `post_title`, `post_excerpt`, `post_status`, `comment_status`, `ping_status`, `post_password`, `post_name`, `to_ping`, `pinged`, `post_modified`, `post_modified_gmt`, `post_content_filtered`, `post_parent`, `guid`, `menu_order`, `post_type`, `post_mime_type`, `comment_count`) VALUES
(322, 1, '2025-04-06 16:48:27', '2025-04-06 16:48:27', '<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"},\"bottom\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"},\"right\":[],\"left\":[]},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"bottom\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}}},\"gradient\":\"center-top-gradient\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"100%\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group has-center-top-gradient-gradient-background has-background\" style=\"border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0px;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"saaslauncher\",\"area\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"tagName\":\"main\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"top\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"},\"bottom\":{\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0px\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"bottom\":\"0px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"gradient\":\"gradient-ten\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"100%\"}} -->\n<main class=\"wp-block-group has-gradient-ten-gradient-background has-background\" style=\"border-top-style:none;border-top-width:0px;border-bottom-style:none;border-bottom-width:0px;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:0px;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:0px;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"var:preset|spacing|30\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|60\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\"}},\"color\":{\"gradient\":\"radial-gradient(rgba(54,30,133,0.84) 0%,rgb(2,0,0) 53%)\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"980px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"background:radial-gradient(rgba(54,30,133,0.84) 0%,rgb(2,0,0) 53%);padding-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--30);padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--60);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40)\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":1,\"fontSize\":\"giga\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-giga-font-size\"><strong>About us</strong></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\",\"left\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\",\"right\":\"var:preset|spacing|50\"}},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"26px\"}},\"gradient\":\"gradient-eleven\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1180px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-gradient-eleven-gradient-background has-background\" style=\"border-radius:26px;padding-top:0;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50);padding-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70);padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--50)\"><!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"40px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"68%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:68%\"><!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-xx-large-font-size\">Our Core Values</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/teams {\"blockClientId\":\"eeb586b7-3401-4b3e-87b7-464beb5f53a6\"} -->\n<div class=\"cozy-block-teams display-grid   hover-show\" id=\"cozyBlock_eeb586b7_3401_4b3e_87b7_464beb5f53a6\"><div class=\"cozy-block-grid-wrapper \"><!-- wp:cozy-block/grid -->\n<div class=\"cozy-block-grid\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":267,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\"><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Неозаглавен-дизайн2.png\" alt=\"Robot taking light \" class=\"wp-image-267\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size\"><strong>Innovation Beyond Boundaries</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-purple\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-purple\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Sanchez\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\">We refuse to accept limits. The future is ours to shape, and we are constantly seeking new ways to merge technology with humanity.  Creating technologies that are not just transformative, but also environmentally conscious.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/grid -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/grid -->\n<div class=\"cozy-block-grid\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":262,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Неозаглавен-дизайн-1-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-262\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size\">Empowerment Through Technology</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-purple\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-purple\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Sanchez\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\">We believe that cybernetics can empower individuals to reach their full potential. Through our products, we enhance not just abilities, but the very essence of human life. The future is for everyone - from kids to adults and more.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/grid -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/grid -->\n<div class=\"cozy-block-grid\"><!-- wp:group -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":266,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Неозаглавен-дизайн1-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-266\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":4,\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h4 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size\">Ethical and Unique Enhancement</h4>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-purple\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-purple\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Sanchez\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\">We understand the power and responsibility that comes with advancing humanity’s capabilities. We are committed to ethical practices in the development and implementation of every enhancement. </p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/grid --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/teams -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"fontSize\":\"xx-large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-xx-large-font-size\">The <strong>Futurionix </strong>Team</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/container {\"blockClientId\":\"0914c9d5-569e-4403-9d8b-3bdd6e683b8f\",\"borderRadius\":{\"topL\":64,\"topR\":64,\"bottomL\":64,\"bottomR\":64}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cozy-block-container\"><div class=\"cozy-block-container visibility-none border-none hover-border-none\n        \n    \" id=\"cozyBlock_0914c9d5_569e_4403_9d8b_3bdd6e683b8f\"><div style=\"position:relative;z-index:10\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":269,\"width\":\"296px\",\"height\":\"auto\",\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"40px\",\"width\":\"0px\",\"style\":\"none\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized has-custom-border\"><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/Неозаглавен-дизайн3-1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-269\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:0px;border-radius:40px;width:296px;height:auto\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-cyan-blue\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-cyan-blue\",\"fontSize\":\"x-large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-vivid-cyan-blue-color has-text-color has-link-color has-x-large-font-size\"><strong>Dr. Selena Wren</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"John Carter\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|primary-shade-one\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"primary-shade-one\",\"fontSize\":\"large\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Strait\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-primary-shade-one-color has-text-color has-link-color has-large-font-size\"><em>Chief Bioengineer</em></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"placeholder\":\"Lorem Ipsum is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry.\",\"style\":{\"elements\":{\"link\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"var:preset|color|vivid-purple\"}}}},\"textColor\":\"vivid-purple\",\"fontSize\":\"medium\",\"cozyCustomFont\":\"Sanchez\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-vivid-purple-color has-text-color has-link-color has-medium-font-size\">With decades of experience in neural integration, Dr. Wren leads the charge in developing mind-machine interfaces that push the boundaries of human cognition.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cozy-block/container -->\n\n<!-- wp:cozy-block/container {\"blockClientId\":\"ba7120e3-dbaa-4446-9532-12bc4afd93b4\",\"borderRadius\":{\"topL\":64,\"topR\":64,\"bottomL\":64,\"bottomR\":64}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cozy-block-container\"><div class=\"cozy-block-container visibilit