(303, 1, '2025-04-06 15:54:40', '2025-04-06 15:54:40', '<h2>Introduction</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Futurionix is a futuristic platform offering cybernetic body enhancements and related content. These Terms govern your use of our site and all purchases made through our store.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Eligibility</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>You must be <strong>at least 18 years old</strong> to use our services or make a purchase. By using Futurionix, you represent that you are of legal age.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Products and Services</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Futurionix provides cybernetic products including (but not limited to): prosthetic limbs, ocular implants, AI-enhanced upgrades, and performance-modifying technology. All products are for enhancement purposes only and must be installed by certified professionals.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Intellectual Property</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>All content on this site, including text, graphics, logos, and images, is the property of Futurionix and protected by copyright and trademark laws. Unauthorized use is strictly prohibited.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Orders and Payment</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><ul><li data-start=\"1384\" data-end=\"1433\"><p data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1433\">All purchases must be paid in full at checkout.</p></li><li data-start=\"1434\" data-end=\"1497\"><p data-start=\"1436\" data-end=\"1497\">Prices are listed in EUR and may change without prior notice.</p></li><li data-start=\"1498\" data-end=\"1551\"><p data-start=\"1500\" data-end=\"1551\">We reserve the right to cancel or refuse any order.</p></li></ul><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Warranty and Returns</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>We provide a <strong>2-year limited warranty for all products.</strong> If your upgrade is defective, contact us <strong>within 30 days for a replacement</strong>. <strong>Custom cybernetic parts are non-refundable</strong> unless they arrive damaged or non-functional.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>User Conduct</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p data-start=\"1839\" data-end=\"1856\">You agree not to:</p><ul data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"2016\"><li data-start=\"1857\" data-end=\"1894\"><p data-start=\"1859\" data-end=\"1894\">Use the Site for unlawful purposes.</p></li><li data-start=\"1895\" data-end=\"1980\"><p data-start=\"1897\" data-end=\"1980\">Attempt to hack, disable, or interfere with any cybernetic systems or the platform.</p></li><li data-start=\"1981\" data-end=\"2016\"><p data-start=\"1983\" data-end=\"2016\">Upload malicious code or content.</p></li></ul><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Limitation of Liability</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Futurionix is not liable for any physical, medical, or psychological issues that may arise from improper use or unauthorized installation of our products.</p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --></p><h2>Changes to Terms</h2><p><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --></p><p>Futurionix reserves the right to change these Terms at any time. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.</p><h2>Contact</h2><p data-start=\"2571\" data-end=\"2637\">If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us at:</p><p data-start=\"2639\" data-end=\"2730\">📧 <strong data-start=\"2642\" data-end=\"2665\"><a rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"2644\" data-end=\"2663\">cyber_sup@gmail.com</a></strong><br data-start=\"2665\" data-end=\"2668\" />📍 Severen Blvd 236, 4027 Plovdiv, Bulgaria<br data-start=\"2711\" data-end=\"2714\" />📞 <strong data-start=\"2717\" data-end=\"2730\">032261261</strong></p><p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->