(406, 1, '2025-06-24 21:54:25', '2025-06-24 21:54:25', '<!-- ========= Timeline Widget Addon For Elementor 1.6.8 ========= -->\n    <!-- Start of Story Repeater Content --><!-- Story Label -->July 5Introduced<!-- Story Icon --><!-- Story Arrow --><!-- Start of Story Content --><!-- Story Title -->Amazon is born<!-- Story Image --><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/plugins/timeline-widget-addon-for-elementor/assets/images/amazon1.jpg\" alt=\"Amazon is born\"><!-- Story Description -->Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit. Erat enim res aperta. Ne discipulum abducam, times. Primum quid tu dicis breve? An haec ab eo non dicuntur?<!-- Start of Story Repeater Content --><!-- Story Label -->February 2Expanded<!-- Story Icon --><!-- Story Arrow --><!-- Start of Story Content --><!-- Story Title -->Amazon Prime debuts<!-- Story Image --><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/plugins/timeline-widget-addon-for-elementor/assets/images/amazon2.jpg\" alt=\"Amazon Prime debuts\"><!-- Story Description -->Aliter homines, aliter philosophos loqui putas oportere? Sin aliud quid voles, postea. Mihi enim satis est, ipsis non satis. Negat enim summo bono afferre incrementum diem. Quod ea non occurrentia fingunt, vincunt Aristonem.<!-- Start of Story Repeater Content --><!-- Story Label -->January 31Expanded<!-- Story Icon --><!-- Story Arrow --><!-- Start of Story Content --><!-- Story Title -->Amazon acquires Audible<!-- Story Image --><img src=\"http://localhost/futurionix/wp-content/plugins/timeline-widget-addon-for-elementor/assets/images/amazon3.png\" alt=\"Amazon acquires Audible\"><!-- Story Description -->Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, consectetur adipiscing elit, sed do eiusmod tempor incididunt ut labore et dolore magna aliqua. Ut enim ad minim veniam, quis nostrud exercitation ullamco laboris nisi ut aliquip ex ea commodo consequat.\n    <style type=\"text/css\">@media (max-width: 1024px){ .twae-wrapper{--tw-ybx-size: 80px !important;}}@media (max-width: 767px){ .twae-wrapper{--tw-ybx-size: 80px !important}}</style>', 'Contacts', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '45-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-06-24 21:54:25', '2025-06-24 21:54:25', '', 45, 'http://localhost/futurionix/?p=406', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
